      "udi": null,
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "sectionTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Assessment topics applicable to development type and scale: Householder applications"
        },
        {
          "alias": "developmentScales",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "Householder Applications"
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "sectionRows",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "d8ef038f-c2b4-45d1-95f2-6b4cd7b32d2a",
                "key": "a65ccb46-66c3-480a-91db-ece0973b40aa",
                "udi": null,
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "content",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Cul data-pm-slice=\u00220 0 []\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting green networks (such as trees, hedgerows, woodland, scrubland, including natural habitats for ecology and biodiversity) should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting blue networks such as waterways, ponds, sustainable drainage systems, swales, rivers, canals, and rain gardens, including natural habitats for wildlife and ecology, should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting landform, topography and levels, including ground conditions, should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eenvironmental impacts (such as land quality, noise, flood risk, air and water\u0026nbsp;quality, microclimates (wind), site orientation in relation to the sun path and areas of shade) should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ehistory and heritage of the site, including the historic character and layout of the site and immediate surroundings, and any other specific features (such as boundary walls, mature trees and hedgerow) that merit conserving, protecting and\u0026nbsp;enhancing should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ekey views in and out of the site which need to deter if there are any local or wider features to consider for visual impacts or\u0026nbsp; reservation next to or near the site\u0026nbsp;should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eboundaries and sensitive edges, considering any sensitive uses or special areas which must have specific design details or requirements (such as landscape,\u0026nbsp;waterside, heritage assets, sites of ecological importance, or areas of open urban green space) should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting land uses, considering adjacent developments or uses in relation to the site (such as open space, local facilities, residential areas, or employment uses) should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting built forms, including layout, heights, scale and massing, should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "149f08a1-2bca-40db-a49b-15c0b4a73226",
                "key": "cc07cf36-01d9-4980-bb5f-70b11efc5a56",
                "udi": null,
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "hide",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "0"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "expose": [
              {
                "contentKey": "a65ccb46-66c3-480a-91db-ece0973b40aa",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              }
            ],
            "Layout": {
              "Umbraco.BlockList": [
                {
                  "contentKey": "a65ccb46-66c3-480a-91db-ece0973b40aa",
                  "contentUdi": null,
                  "settingsKey": "cc07cf36-01d9-4980-bb5f-70b11efc5a56",
                  "settingsUdi": null
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "d766ba62-8c3e-4fc6-91b7-06a60dcacc07",
      "key": "9c10edc6-6e0f-4303-8907-c3a9b3ab52d8",
      "udi": null,
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "sectionTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Assessment topics applicable to development type/scale: Minor residential and minor employment applications"
        },
        {
          "alias": "developmentScales",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "Minor Residential Applications (1-9 homes)",
            "Major Employment Applications"
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "sectionRows",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "d8ef038f-c2b4-45d1-95f2-6b4cd7b32d2a",
                "key": "394d068d-100b-4731-b7d5-8c08c6785a95",
                "udi": null,
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "content",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Cul data-pm-slice=\u00220 0 []\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting green networks (such as trees, hedgerows, woodland, scrubland,\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eincluding natural habitats for ecology and biodiversity) must be assessed\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting blue networks (such as waterways, ponds, sustainable drainage systems, swales, rivers, canals, and rain gardens), including natural habitats for wildlife and ecology, must be assessed\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting landform, topography and levels, including ground conditions, must be assessed\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eenvironmental impacts (such as land quality, noise, flood risk, air and water quality, microclimates (such as wind), site orientation in relation to the sun path and areas of shade) must be assessed\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ehistory and heritage of the site, including the historic character and layout of the site and immediate surroundings, and any other specific features (such as boundary walls, mature trees and hedgerow) that merit conserving, protecting and enhancing must be assessed\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ekey views in and out of the site which need to deter if there are any local or wider features to consider for visual impacts or reservation next to or near the site should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eboundaries and sensitive edges, considering any sensitive uses or special areas which must have specific design details or requirements (such as landscape, waterside, heritage assets, sites of ecological importance, or areas of open urban green space) should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting land uses, considering adjacent developments or uses in relation to the site (such as open space, local facilities, residential areas, or employment uses) must be assessed\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eaccess, movement, and accessibility, considering how the site will connect to existing movement corridors or networks to avoid disconnected cul-desac designs, and how will it be inclusive and accessible for all users of the development must be assessed\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting pedestrian and cycle routes, considering if there are opportunities to connect to existing Byways, Bridleways, or Public Rights of Way, natural routes or to create new routes for people to use to encourage active travel opportunities in and around the site should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting local facilities and public transport routes and identifying how far people will need to walk to access these and whether there are shops near the site should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eexisting built forms, including layout, heights, scale and massing, should be considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "149f08a1-2bca-40db-a49b-15c0b4a73226",
                "key": "fc667952-7a7d-4657-989e-e64097aad9e7",
                "udi": null,
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "hide",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "0"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "expose": [
